oblasts.jpg/500px-Active_osteoblasts.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Light micrograph of decalcified cancellous bone tissue displaying osteoblasts actively synthesizing osteoid, containing two osteocytes.","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AActive_osteoblasts.jpg"}],"sounds":{},"pictures":[{"title":"Aynsely China England Bone China Crest","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1b/Aynsely_China_England_Bone_China_Crest.jpg/500px-Aynsely_China_England_Bone_China_Crest.jpg","ratio":0.9318578916715201,"link":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Aynsely_China_England_Bone_China_Crest.jpg","share":0.725},{"title":"Strawberry on white background","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/ee/Strawberry_on_white_background.jpg/500px-Strawberry_on_white_background.jpg","ratio":1.618,"link":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Strawberry_on_white_background.jpg","share":0.70375},{"title":"20251026 Oracle Bone with Inscription","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/bf/20251026_Oracle_Bone_with_Inscription.jpg/500px-20251026_Oracle_Bone_with_Inscription.jpg","ratio":0.6666666666666666,"link":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20251026_Oracle_Bone_with_Inscription.jpg","share":0.645},{"title":"Piece of chocolate cake on a white plate decorated with chocolate sauce","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/ef/Piece_of_chocolate_cake_on_a_white_plate_decorated_with_chocolate_sauce.jpg/500px-Piece_of_chocolate_cake_on_a_white_plate_decorated_with_chocolate_sauce.jpg","ratio":1.4699946893255444,"link":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Piece_of_chocolate_cake_on_a_white_plate_decorated_with_chocolate_sauce.jpg","share":0.4875},{"title":"Latrobe White House cropa2","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8c/Latrobe_White_House_cropa2.jpg/500px-Latrobe_White_House_cropa2.jpg","ratio":0.78763666